<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>fabric-processing</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/cut-and-sew.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/polos.css">
</head>

<body>
     <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-bg-container">
            <img src="../photos/fabric-processing.webp" alt="Vito and Will folded polo shirts" class="hero-image">
        </div>

    </section>
    <section class="manufacturing-services">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Fabric Washing & Processing Services</h2>

            <p class="section-text">
                Clothing trends have evolved so much over the years that fabric processing has now become a huge part of
                any attire. Due to modern-day revolutions, scientists have discovered many different ways to make the
                fabric more reliable, softer, unique, and comfortable. Many of these processes have also moved beyond
                denim to 100% cotton as well as blends of polyester and cotton.




            </p>

            <p class="section-text">
                To give vintage and classical looks to garments, people use different techniques involving specialized
                washing processes that highlight fabric attributes without reducing reliability or longevity. Wuzwear
                Industry provides tremendous options in this range with minimum order quantities starting from just 50
                pieces.





            </p>
            <p>With options like Acid Washing, Enzyme Washing, and Burnout Processing, brands can build a full vintage
                collection or include vintage-inspired items in their existing line. Other techniques such as Silicone
                Washing, Bio Washing, and Preshrunk Washing help solve issues like shrinkage, wrinkling, and pressing,
                making your garments more durable and consumer-friendly. Wuzwear Industry offers all these services and
                guides clients to select the best option based on their requirements.

            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/fabric-processing1.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Preshrunk Washing</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        Some fabrics, when knitted or woven, tend to leave empty spaces that cause garments to shrink
                        when washed.



                    </p>
                    <p>To prevent this, Wuzwear Industry offers preshrunk washing, which tightens the fibers in
                        advance. This ensures that when customers wash their garments at home—whether in hot or cold
                        water—the fit remains intact. A medium stays a medium even after multiple washes.

                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row row-reverse">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/fabric-processing2.webp" alt="Tailor working with denim fabric at a workbench">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Silicon Washing</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        At Wuzwear Industry, silicon washing can be applied to garments to increase softness and
                        durability. It also acts as a pre-shrinking treatment, binding fibers more tightly.




                    </p>
                    <p>This process gives garments a luxurious feel, helping them stay soft and fresh even after several
                        washes. Silicon washing makes clothing more comfortable and reliable, increasing customer
                        satisfaction.



                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="dye-services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="dye-row">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/fabric-processing3.webp" alt="Colorful sublimated and dyed athletic t-shirts">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Bio Washing</h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        Wuzwear Industry offers bio washing for an eco-friendly enhancement to your garments. This
                        process not only softens the fabric but also adds extra shine while preserving color vibrancy
                        for longer periods.



                    </p>
                    <p>Unlike harsh chemical detergents, bio washing uses natural soap suds, brightening agents, and
                        conditioners, making it a sustainable option that maintains both quality and comfort.


                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="dye-row row-reverse">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/fabric-processing4.webp"
                        alt="A collection of vibrant fabric color swatches arranged together">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Enzyme Washing</h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        At Wuzwear Industry, enzyme washing improves color fastness, rubbing resistance, and overall
                        smoothness of garments. This treatment enhances the anti-pilling properties of fabric, resulting
                        in a refined, polished look.



                    </p>
                    <p>We offer both acid enzyme wash and neutral enzyme wash, each with unique benefits. For brands
                        aiming for a premium, fashion-forward appeal, enzyme washing is highly recommended.



                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>


<%- include('partials/popup') %>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>

</html>